    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061107.0269\n\nBERLIN, Nov. 7 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nGerman stocks end higher\n\n\n\n\nGerman stocks ended higher on Tuesday on the Frankfurt market.\n\nThe 30-share benchmark DAX Index surged 0.49 percent or 31.31 points to 6,361.96.\n\nThe MDAX index of medium-sized companies gained 0.16 percent or 14.17 points to 8,815.42.\n\nThe TecDAX index of technologies and science firms rose 1.80 percent or 12.50 points to 705.24 points.",
